  m_text: '<size=130%>[Game Title]</size>

    <size=80%>a voice-casting magic adventure</size>





    <size=110%>Team
    SwuriSwuri</size>



    <size=80%>Team Lead | Game Design & Unity Client</size>

    Sieun
    Hwang



    <size=80%>Speech Recognition (AI)</size>

    Dawon Jeong

    Shin
    Chaeun



    <size=80%>Server & Database</size>

    Yoon Jiwon



    <size=80%>Art
    & Assets</size>

    Sieun Hwang



    <size=80%>Planning & QA</size>

    Team
    SwuriSwuri





    <size=110%>Built With</size>



    Unity 6   |   FastAPI  
    |   faster-whisper   |   Vosk





    <size=110%>3D Models</size>

    <size=75%>via
    Poly Pizza</size>



    <size=85%>Castle, Arch Door, Demon, Yeti, Zombie - Quaternius

    Castle
    - CreativeTrio

    Wall Doorway Round - Kenney

    Roman Arch - Icawfype

    Seat
    - CMHT Oculus

    Armchair - jeremy

    Jurassic Trophy - Alberto Calvo

    Fire
    - Jakob Hippe

    Valley Terrain, Staff - Zsky

    Simple Wooden Wand - Garrett
    LeFever

    Crown - Poly by Google</size>

    <size=85%>Monsters - Quaternius

    Hooded
    Fox - Tibo

    Environment Props - k0rveen</size>





    <size=110%>Animations</size>



    <size=85%>Mixamo</size>





    <size=110%>Visual
    Effects</size>



    <size=85%>Cartoon FX Remaster Free - Jean Moreno (JMO)

    Stylized
    VFX Doodles / Stylized Water Effects - NamuFX

    Hits Effects FREE - Matthew
    Guz

    Free Game VFX / Magic Circle - Eric VFX Studio

    Stylized Fire -
    Hun0FX

    Casual Hit

    Free Quick Effects Vol.1 - Gabriel Aguiar Prod

    Magic
    Effects Free / Procedural Fire - Hovl Studio

    Stat Scroll VFX - TwoUncle

    VFX
    Fantasy Pack - UIUX Forge Dev

    Water Spell - FlexUnit

    Kino Bloom - Keijiro
    Takahashi</size>





    <size=110%>Music & Sound Effects</size>

    <size=75%>via
    Pixabay</size>



    <size=85%>All music and sound effects from Pixabay creators

    pixabay.com</size>





    <size=110%>UI</size>



    <size=85%>Complete
    UI Book Styles Pack

    Tiny RPG Mana Soul GUI

    Medieval / Fantasy UI elements
    - toffeecraft</size>





    <size=110%>Fonts</size>



    <size=85%>ONE Mobile
    Title

    Hangeul Jaemin 4</size>





    <size=110%>Special Thanks</size>



    Our
    professor and everyone who playtested





    <size=110%>Sungshin Women''s University</size>

    2026
    Convergence Capstone Design'
